#: scenario7:scenario7_2FA8154B_757D_40E8_B98D_4630AF243643
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 144eb63ada44c470bc9d8d3de866d87f26771b83c598fcae3c0a112d1bdd9c13
