msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫И имя мне Моргана."

#: scenario7:scenario7_771B2BBE_68D4_4842_B6F4_FAF4FD301BC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4c12139f94b59c87dfc581ddd9d9411895a95f061c42628dd01f9a69a5a95aa
