#: scenario7:scenario7_745E07C6_2877_4A93_BE88_6009A8257722
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd433a2176d473eacd92926ca15bf4192b429478f3767cdaa24b2c1160f235c1
