#: scenario7:scenario7_5455BC8D_74CC_4A29_9CA7_A75AD3ED4949
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17902188854904816aad44730f0002a35402097a639c388eb59971b797a232cd
#. default-sha256: 9162289f7d2d788147026358df0226b92032d219c8680b026776eb117f014c1c
