#: scenario7:scenario7_0A5F76DF_0B8B_46B1_A2CA_DA1DDCF29E00
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1418c1096c6d7533215376feb67bbcc842d4cb98e64a7295c3aa0dc257eb786b
